      "value": "@{5a53109fa7e3bd02f1023fb1|full_name}: The sitting problem you have, I am able to fix by changing between Sit and Stand modes.  It takes some fiddling but you'd get used to how it works.  It's not perfect but at least can still work.\n\nI still would like to see IPD scale with or even separately from Avatar viewpoint or avatar width. IPD scale seems to be directly effected by Height to width ratio, mostly Width (Arm length)\n\nWith leg tracking, I do notice my head decouples from my view point, if I shift my hip tracker up and down.",
